In our model, the core mechanism lies in the relationship between the pressure difference of the protoplasm and the locomotion speed. In our simulation, the deceleration of locomotion speed under stimulation was decreased by repeated stimulation (Fig. 6). Thus, we regarded deceleration during stimulation as a response to the stimulation. The variable \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
